    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be a function defined <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></msqrt></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>",
